<title>USA: Data Systems Network to redeem warrants.</title>
<headline>Data Systems Network to redeem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Systems Network Corp said Thursday it will redeem on March 10, 1997 its outstanding redeemable common stock purchase warrants at $0.05 per purchase warrant.</p>
<p>The right to exercise the purchase warrant expires on the redemption date.</p>
<p>Data Systems provides computer network integration and data management services.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
